  "_comment": [
    "A snapshot of what the database will actually accept, taken 2026-09-09.",
    "test/schema-drift.js compares every write in src/ against this. It exists",
    "because four separate features were silently broken by the code writing a",
    "value the schema rejected -- every notification in the product, cutting an",
    "idea, the coach thread, and deactivating an account -- with the errors",
    "swallowed at the call site so nothing surfaced.",
    "Regenerate after any migration that adds a column or changes a CHECK."
